Description: Econet (AUN) NetFS/NetPrint file server for BBC Micro and RISC OS
 aun-filestore is an Econet fileserver implementation (using AUN) for Linux,
 written in PHP. It provides file and print services to Acorn RISC machines and
 emulated BBC Micros on top of a layer 2 emulation of Econet, and includes a
 browser-based admin interface.
 .
 The package ships systemd units for the main server (aun-filestored) and the
 optional out-of-process service providers (sharefsd, dnsd, ntpd, ecosyslogd,
 sql-serverd). None are enabled by default; the provider units require
 aun-filestored.service.
